    <string name="board_foot">Off by default. Allowed people open a GitHub issue with a mika-task block; Mika claims it, runs it on this phone and replies with the verdict, steps and screenshots. Payments are never made and confirmations are always declined; anything that needs one is reported back instead.</string>
